 "sentences": [
  "Arnold Bax wrote under a secret name.",
  "This English composer published fiction and verse as Dermot O'Byrne.",
  "He was born into a wealthy family in London.",
  "His private income let him ignore musical trends and fashion.",
  "As a student, he became fascinated with Irish and Celtic culture.",
  "He eventually wrote 7 symphonies and became a leading British symphonist.",
  "Later, his focus shifted from Celtic roots to Nordic culture."
